DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes Kany Garcia—the Puerto Rican si
	nger-songwriter and pop star—to the Sugar Land stage.  \nShe’s been a pote
	nt presence in Latin music since 2007\, when her debut album Cualquier Día
	 (Any Day) generated four hit singles\, including “Hoy Ya Me Voy (Today I’
	m Going)”\, on Billboard’s Latin charts and earned her Latin Grammy awards
	 for Best Female Pop Vocal Album and Best New Artist. \nAdmission\nTickets
	 start at $48. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Li
	sting was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar wit
	h images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organ
